# PBIX = backup only, never source (see CLAUDE.md)
*.pbix

# Model data cache — a full local copy of the model (21 MB for AVS).
# This is the one thing that must never reach GitHub.
# Everything else under .pbi/ is JSON and IS tracked.
**/.pbi/cache.abf
**/cache.abf

# Pre-edit copies written under Rule #1 (see CLAUDE.md) — local safety net, not history.
__backup__/

# Report + model definitions under any __<CODE>/ report project: local only, never pushed (2026-09-12).
# Already-tracked copies were removed from the index with `git rm --cached`; files stay on disk.
__*/*.Report/
__*/*.SemanticModel/
